---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { brand } from "../brand.js";
---

<Layout
  title="Buy Doclira PDF - Plans and License"
  description="Choose a Doclira PDF plan, purchase securely through Gumroad and receive a license key for the Windows installer."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="guide-page">
    <section class="guide-intro">
      <p class="kicker">BUY DOCLIRA PDF</p>
      <h1>Choose the plan that matches your PDF workload.</h1>
      <p>Download and install Doclira PDF first. Purchasing only gives you an activation key that unlocks the paid plan inside the same Windows app.</p>
      <div class="actions page-actions">
        <a class="primary" href={brand.purchaseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Buy activation key</a>
        <a class="secondary" href="/download/">Download installer first</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plans standalone-plans">
      {brand.pricing.map((plan) => (
        <article class={`plan-card ${plan.highlight ? "highlight" : ""}`}>
          {plan.highlight && <span class="plan-badge">Recommended</span>}
          <h2>{plan.name}</h2>
          <p class="plan-price">{plan.price}</p>
          <p>{plan.audience}</p>
          <strong>{plan.ai}</strong>
          <ul>{plan.features.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="guide-grid">
      <article>
        <p class="step-number">01</p>
        <h2>Download the installer</h2>
        <p>Install Doclira PDF from the download page. The app can open in free mode before activation.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="step-number">02</p>
        <h2>Buy a license key</h2>
        <p>Choose Pro, Business or Enterprise on Gumroad. Gumroad handles payment and license key delivery.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="step-number">03</p>
        <h2>Activate</h2>
        <p>Open Doclira PDF, click Activate, enter the license key from the receipt and unlock your purchased plan.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="step-number">04</p>
        <h2>Get help</h2>
        <p>If installation or advertised features do not work, contact support with screenshots and non-sensitive sample details.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="ai-credits" class="credit-section">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">AI CREDIT PACKS</p>
        <h2>Need more AI runs?</h2>
        <p>Paid plans include one-time AI credits. If a user runs out, they can buy an AI credit pack and redeem the code inside Doclira PDF.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="credit-card">
        <span class="download-tag">Add-on</span>
        <h3>AI Credits Pack</h3>
        <p>For users who already have Doclira PDF and only need more AI document summaries, translations or Q&A runs.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Delivered as an AI credit redemption key</li>
          <li>Credits are added to the current balance</li>
          <li>Existing license plan remains unchanged</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="primary inline-button" href={brand.aiCreditsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Buy AI Credits</a>
        <p class="credit-note">After checkout, enter the AI credit key in the app: AI Credits -> Redeem Credits.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="purchase-note">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">BEFORE YOU BUY</p>
        <h2>Clear expectations</h2>
        <p>Doclira is practical for batch watermarking, conversion, compression, page organization, image export and AI document assistance. It is not positioned as a complete Acrobat or UPDF replacement for complex visual PDF editing.</p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Works on Windows 10 / 11 64-bit.</li>
        <li>Core PDF processing runs locally on your computer.</li>
        <li>AI features require internet and consume your AI credit balance.</li>
        <li>7-day refund review for installation and advertised feature issues.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta">
      <h2>Ready to use Doclira PDF?</h2>
      <p>Start with Lite if you want to test the workflow, or purchase a paid plan for real office PDF work.</p>
      <div class="actions page-actions">
        <a class="primary" href={brand.purchaseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Buy on Gumroad</a>
        <a class="secondary" href="/support/">Contact support</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
